  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "DISCOVERY FIELDNOTES / OPPORTUNITY 01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Clarify kit pickup before travel"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "From Studio Research to product and service partners Fictional training example · 30 September 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose the next learning step, not a feature commitment. Test what borrowers need to know before…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "The outcome people need"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Know whether a suitable kit can be collected before making the trip. OPP-F01 frames this opportunity…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Scope: occasional borrowers at one fictional community tool library. No general demand estimate,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Current workaround"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Borrowers phone; a volunteer checks a paper board. Four of five S01 journeys included a call. One…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Customer benefit to test"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Fewer avoidable journeys and enough confidence to collect the right kit. Neither outcome has been…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Organizational relevance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A clearer handoff might reduce interruptions while keeping useful advice available. Volunteer time,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What could change this view"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A call may provide reassurance or repair advice. E05 also shows that not everyone calls. The current…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "READ ON Evidence / Responses / Next test"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Evidence and its limits"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "OPP-F01 observation: four of five S01 borrowers called. Interpretation: readiness uncertainty may…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "S01 has five distinct people. Evidence IDs below are one record per journey; records are not extra…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Synthetic notes, not quotations. Short E and S labels use the OPP prefix. E04 remains missing. Source…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Compare responses before choosing"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "OPP-F01 supports exploring the need. It does not validate any response below. Compare distinct ways to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "No weighted score or winner is assigned. Customer benefit, organizational relevance and feasibility are…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The proposed decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "OPP-D01 · Proposed: fund a small discovery test before selecting A or B. No implementation, budget,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Design the next learning test"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "OPP-T01 asks whether readiness information answers the pre-travel question, and when a conversation is…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Proposed protocol: recruit occasional borrowers with different kit familiarity. Use a neutral pickup…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Record behavior and explanation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Record the first route, whether a call follows, the question asked, assistance and the person’s…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Decide what would disconfirm it"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "If people still need advice with accurate status present, reject the assumption that status alone…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldLabel",
      "text": "STATUS Proposed / no sessions or results"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Decision record"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Product and service partners must name a responsible owner and agree a review date. Neither is assigned…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Bring these gaps to review"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Missing: E04 pickup outcome; call motives; readiness-update responsibility; staffing capacity; cost;…"
    },
    {
      "style": "FieldNote",
      "text": "Before reuse, replace every synthetic ID and source note with permitted evidence. Preserve…"
    }
